Ask "How many gloves (boxes) we have?" and call answer gloves.
Ask "How many masks (boxes) we have?" and call answer masks.
Ask "How many bandages (packs) we have?" and call answer bandages.
Ask "How many hand gel (bottles) we have?" and call answer handgel.

If gloves is below 20, show "gloves" and 40 minus gloves.
If masks is below 15, show "masks" and 30 minus masks.
If bandages is below 30, show "bandages" and 60 minus bandages.
If handgel is below 10, show "hand gel" and 20 minus handgel.

If gloves is at least 20 and masks is at least 15 and bandages is at least 30 and handgel is at least 10, say "Nothing to order this week."
